#: ../../language/attributes/non_exhaustive.md:1
msgid "Non-exhaustive Enum Attribute"
msgstr "非穷尽枚举属性"

#: ../../language/attributes/non_exhaustive.md:3
msgid ""
"The `#non_exhaustive` attribute marks an `enum` whose defining package "
"may add constructors in a future release. It is valid only on enum "
"declarations."
msgstr ""
"`#non_exhaustive` 属性用于标记定义包可能在未来版本中添加构造器的 "
"`enum`。它只能用于枚举声明。"

#: ../../language/attributes/non_exhaustive.md:6
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"#non_exhaustive\n"
"pub(all) enum Response {\n"
"  Ok(String)\n"
"  NotFound\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/attributes/non_exhaustive.md:12
msgid ""
"Code outside the defining package must handle potential future "
"constructors with a `Type::..` pattern:"
msgstr "定义包之外的代码必须使用 `Type::..` 模式处理未来可能出现的构造器："

#: ../../language/attributes/non_exhaustive.md:15
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"pub fn render(response : @base.Response) -> String {\n"
"  match response {\n"
"    @base.Ok(body) => body\n"
"    @base.NotFound => \"not found\"\n"
"    @base.Response::.. => \"unsupported response\"\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/attributes/non_exhaustive.md:21
msgid ""
"The `Type::..` pattern is specifically for forward compatibility. It does"
" not replace the enum's currently known constructors: match those "
"constructors explicitly before this pattern. A wildcard pattern (`_`) is "
"not a substitute for `Type::..` when handling constructors added by a "
"future version of the defining package."
msgstr ""
"`Type::..` 模式专用于前向兼容。它不能替代枚举中当前已知的构造器：这些"
"构造器必须在该模式之前显式匹配。处理定义包未来版本新增的构造器时，通配符"
"模式（`_`）不能替代 `Type::..`。"

#: ../../language/attributes/non_exhaustive.md:27
msgid ""
"Adding a constructor to a `#non_exhaustive` enum is therefore compatible "
"with downstream matches that use `Type::..`."
msgstr ""
"因此，只要下游匹配使用了 `Type::..`，为 `#non_exhaustive` 枚举新增构造器"
"就是兼容变更。"
